<VI _name="lvtd_bind_elements.vi" description="Makes cluster elements of a typedef .ctl instances of other typedef files - ALL of them in ONE open and ONE save - and reports each element's typedef flag and label afterwards. {LV.Control} Replace with the typedef's Path does the binding\3B it is a silent no-op outside the IDE's own application instance\2C so the .ctl is opened through Project\3AActive Project and a project must be active. ONE RUN FOR EVERY ELEMENT IS THE POINT\3A measured 2026-09-25\2C binding two elements in two separate open-replace-save runs left an extra copy of the first typedef's descriptor at the head of the file's type list\2C where one run with both Replaces does not. Replace KEEPS the element's label\2C measured with a typedef whose own control is labelled differently\2C so no label is written. The lists arrive as strings separated by a vertical bar\2C a character no Windows path contains\2C because RunVIAsTopLevel cannot set an array control. No pylabview. Driven by lvai_create_typedef.">
